  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc2000.html",
  "prefLabel": "Plc 2003.05 Additional Information and Documentation for Initial Applications",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 2003.05 Additional Information and Documentation for Initial Applications. In addition to the information required by Plc 304.03 and the documentation required by Plc 304.04, an applicant for voluntary certification as a CHW shall provide the following:\n\n(a) If qualified based on work experience, the following information for each position held at which qualifying tasks were performed:\n\n(1) The name and address of the organization at which or for which the qualifying duties were undertaken;\n\n(2) The month and year when the work was started and when the work ended;\n\n(3) The total hours spent engaged in qualifying duties;\n\n(4) The specific qualifying duties undertaken; and\n\n(5) The name, daytime telephone number, and position held of an individual who can verify the information required by (1) through (4), above; and\n\n(b) If qualified based on training:\n\n(1) The following information for each organization that provided the training:\n\na. Name, address, telephone number, and email address; and\n\nb. Date training started and date training completed; and\n\n(2) A copy of the training certificate issued at the completion of the training.\n\nSource. #14388, eff 10-24-25, EXPIRES: 10-24-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc2000.html"
